    <string name="coding_title">Coding</string>
    <string name="coding_warning">Writes configuration into a module. A wrong value can make a function stop working or a module misbehave, and may affect your warranty. Only use a recipe written for this exact model and year. Restraints, brakes and steering are never written. A module that asks for a security key is left untouched. The battery must be above 12.2 V and the car stopped.</string>
    <string name="coding_format">One change per line:\nMODULE BLOCK OFFSET OLD NEW   (726 DE01 2 4F 5F)\nMODULE BLOCK OLDBLOCK NEWBLOCK   (726 DE01 0804B0 0804F0)\nLines starting with # are comments.</string>
